                                                "sense_id": "35b41b08-5030-389c-bde8-4dec7cc163a1",
                                                "text": "Pourd out their plenty, without spight or spare:"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3b5d5c7c-6e0b-3030-847f-d282c4b2d646",
